@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ito-il29-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il29-time`
IMPORT `ito-s1-israeli-resident-individual`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Row IL-29: constructors for the people the tests ask about.  No assertions here.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Individuals`

-- The most general constructor: every field that can vary.
GIVEN y        IS A NUMBER
      days     IS A `Days in Israel`
      finding  IS A MAYBE `Where the centre of life is`
      ties     IS A MAYBE `The ties of an individual`
      rebutted IS A BOOLEAN
      emp      IS A MAYBE `Employment facts for regulation 2`
      reg3     IS A MAYBE `Facts for regulation 3`
      adj      IS A MAYBE `Facts for the adjustment year of section 14(b)`
GIVETH AN `An individual in a tax year, for the definition of Israeli resident`
`the individual in` y `with` days `, found` finding `, ties` ties `, rebutted:` rebutted `, regulation 2` emp `, regulation 3` reg3 `, section 14(b)` adj MEANS
    `An individual in a tax year, for the definition of Israeli resident` WITH
        `the tax year`                 IS `the calendar tax year` y
        `the tax year before it`       IS `the calendar tax year` (y MINUS 1)
        `the tax year before that`     IS `the calendar tax year` (y MINUS 2)
        `the days in Israel`           IS days
        `the centre of life, as found` IS finding
        `the ties`                     IS ties
        `the presumption has been rebutted, by the individual or by the assessing officer` IS rebutted
        `employment facts for regulation 2` IS emp
        `facts for regulation 3`       IS reg3
        `facts for section 14(b)`      IS adj

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
      c IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Days in Israel`
`days counted` a `,` b `,` c MEANS `counted by the caller` WITH `in the tax year` IS a, `in the tax year before it` IS b, `in the tax year before that` IS c

-- No finding, no ties, no rebuttal, nothing else reaches him: the day counts alone.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
      c IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An individual in a tax year, for the definition of Israeli resident`
`a plain individual in` y `, days` a `,` b `,` c MEANS
    `the individual in` y `with` (`days counted` a `,` b `,` c) `, found` NOTHING `, ties` NOTHING `, rebutted:` FALSE `, regulation 2` NOTHING `, regulation 3` NOTHING `, section 14(b)` NOTHING

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
      c IS A NUMBER
      w IS A `Where the centre of life is`
GIVETH AN `An individual in a tax year, for the definition of Israeli resident`
`an individual in` y `, days` a `,` b `,` c `, whose centre of life was found` w MEANS
    `the individual in` y `with` (`days counted` a `,` b `,` c) `, found` (JUST w) `, ties` NOTHING `, rebutted:` FALSE `, regulation 2` NOTHING `, regulation 3` NOTHING `, section 14(b)` NOTHING

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
      c IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An individual in a tax year, for the definition of Israeli resident`
`an individual in` y `, days` a `,` b `,` c `, whose presumption was rebutted` MEANS
    `the individual in` y `with` (`days counted` a `,` b `,` c) `, found` NOTHING `, ties` NOTHING `, rebutted:` TRUE `, regulation 2` NOTHING `, regulation 3` NOTHING `, section 14(b)` NOTHING

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      a IS A NUMBER
      t IS A `The ties of an individual`
GIVETH AN `An individual in a tax year, for the definition of Israeli resident`
`an individual in` y `with` a `days and the ties` t MEANS
    `the individual in` y `with` (`days counted` a `,` 0 `,` 0) `, found` NOTHING `, ties` (JUST t) `, rebutted:` FALSE `, regulation 2` NOTHING `, regulation 3` NOTHING `, section 14(b)` NOTHING

GIVEN w IS A `Where a tie lies`
GIVETH A `The ties of an individual`
`ties that all lie` w MEANS
    `The ties of an individual` WITH
        `his permanent home`                                    IS w
        `where he and his family members live`                  IS w
        `his usual or permanent occupation or employment`       IS w
        `his active and material economic interests`            IS w
        `his activity in organisations, unions or institutions` IS w

`ties that lie both ways` MEANS
    `The ties of an individual` WITH
        `his permanent home`                                    IS `lies in Israel`
        `where he and his family members live`                  IS `lies in Israel`
        `his usual or permanent occupation or employment`       IS `lies outside Israel`
        `his active and material economic interests`            IS `lies in Israel`
        `his activity in organisations, unions or institutions` IS `lies in Israel`

§ `Readings`

-- The default readings, with one fork set; generated by tools/gen_readings.py, one constructor per fork (L4 has no record update).

GIVEN x IS A `A reading of ties that all lie one way`
GIVETH A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
`the defaults, except ties read` x MEANS
    `The readings of the forks of row IL-29` WITH
        `ties` IS x
        `rebuttal` IS `declined where a rebutted presumption is the only fact`
        `windows` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `five years` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `ninety days` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `journalist or athlete` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `years deemed` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `partial day` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `both statuses` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `part-year connection` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `midpoint` IS `declined where the midpoint decides`
        `excess deduction` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `old schedule` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `depreciation base` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `part month` IS `declined where the readings differ`
        `part month of depreciation` IS `declined where the readings differ`

GIVEN x IS A `A reading of a rebutted presumption`
GIVETH A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
